# Groq API key for the AI features. Get one free at https://console.groq.com/keys
#
# NOTE THE MISSING "VITE_" PREFIX — that is the whole point.
# Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle at build time, so a
# VITE_GROQ_API_KEY would be readable by anyone who opens the deployed site.
# This one is read only by the serverless function in api/analyze.ts and never
# reaches the browser.
#
# On Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add GROQ_API_KEY,
# then redeploy. Locally: copy this file to .env and run `vercel dev`
# (a plain `vite` dev server does not serve /api, so the AI UI stays hidden).
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_key_here
